---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title={"White Label PPC &amp; Google Ads Management for Agencies"} description={"Outsource your agency"}>
<!-- HEADER -->


<main class="pt-20">

  <!-- ═══ HERO ═══ -->
  <section class="grid-bg py-20 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full opacity-15 pointer-events-none" style="background:radial-gradient(circle,#0066FF,transparent 70%)" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 mb-4">White-Label PPC &amp; Paid Social</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-5 leading-[1.1]" style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif">
        White-Label PPC Management &amp; <span class="gradient-text">Paid Social Fulfillment</span> Services
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-9">Outsource your agency's paid search and paid social execution. Enterprise-grade campaign setup, daily budget optimization, and white-labeled reporting — all delivered invisibly under your brand.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/consultation" class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-semibold text-white justify-center w-full sm:w-auto">
          Book a Free Consultation
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="btn-outline inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-medium text-slate-400 justify-center w-full sm:w-auto">Explore Full Ad Ops Fulfillment</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ STAT STRIP ═══ -->
  <section class="py-10 px-6 border-y" style="border-color:rgba(0,102,255,.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="stat-box">
        <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-1" style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0066FF,#00B4D8);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">100%</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">White-labeled under your brand</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-box">
        <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-1" style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0066FF,#00B4D8);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">Daily</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Budget pacing &amp; bid optimization</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-box">
        <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-1" style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0066FF,#00B4D8);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">0</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">New hires to scale capacity</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ INTRO ═══ -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose">
      <p>Paid search and paid social are where your clients expect results — and where execution is the most unforgiving. Factor42 Media gives growing agencies a dedicated, platform-certified PPC and paid social team that builds, optimizes, and reports on every campaign under your brand. You keep the client relationship and the strategy; we handle the enterprise-grade execution behind the scenes. It's the paid-media arm of our complete <a href="/" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">white-label ad operations fulfillment</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ H2 BLOCK 1: GOOGLE ADS ═══ -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6 border-t" style="border-color:rgba(0,102,255,.08)">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 mb-3">Paid Search</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 leading-snug" style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif">Expert Google Ads Setup and Optimization for Your Clients</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-base leading-relaxed mb-5">From the first keyword build to ongoing daily management, our certified specialists run your clients' Google Ads accounts to enterprise standards — structured for performance, measured accurately, and optimized continuously.</p>
        <ul class="prose">
          <li>Full account architecture across Search, Performance Max, Display, and Shopping</li>
          <li>Conversion tracking and pixel implementation verified before launch</li>
          <li>Daily budget pacing, bid strategy management, and search-term mining</li>
          <li>Microsoft Ads (Bing) coverage for incremental reach</li>
          <li>White-labeled performance reporting on your cadence</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl p-8 text-white" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0052CC,#0066FF 55%,#00B4D8)">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-100 mb-4">What you get</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5">✓</span> Certified Google Ads managers as an extension of your team</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5">✓</span> Error-free setup with documented QA on every build</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5">✓</span> Proactive optimization, not set-and-forget</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5">✓</span> Reporting that carries your logo, not ours</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ H2 BLOCK 2: PAID SOCIAL ═══ -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6 border-t" style="border-color:rgba(0,102,255,.08)">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 rounded-2xl p-8" style="background:rgba(0,102,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(0,102,255,.15)">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 mb-4">Platforms we run</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
          <span class="rounded-lg px-3 py-2 bg-white border" style="border-color:rgba(0,102,255,.12)">Meta (FB/IG)</span>
          <span class="rounded-lg px-3 py-2 bg-white border" style="border-color:rgba(0,102,255,.12)">TikTok</span>
          <span class="rounded-lg px-3 py-2 bg-white border" style="border-color:rgba(0,102,255,.12)">LinkedIn</span>
          <span class="rounded-lg px-3 py-2 bg-white border" style="border-color:rgba(0,102,255,.12)">Pinterest</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 mb-3">Paid Social</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 leading-snug" style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif">Scale Capacity with Dedicated Paid Social Media Support</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-base leading-relaxed mb-5">Win the account, then let a dedicated paid social team absorb the execution. We build audiences, traffic creative, manage budgets, and report — so your account managers can take on more clients without burning out or hiring ahead of revenue.</p>
        <ul class="prose">
          <li>Campaign builds across Meta, TikTok, LinkedIn, and Pinterest</li>
          <li>Audience strategy, creative trafficking, and A/B testing</li>
          <li>Pixel and conversions API setup with QA sign-off</li>
          <li>Daily monitoring, pacing, and optimization</li>
          <li>Variable capacity that scales up and down with your book</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ FAQ ═══ -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6 border-t" style="border-color:rgba(0,102,255,.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,.55)">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center" style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="rounded-xl border p-5" style="border-color:rgba(0,102,255,.15);background:rgba(255,255,255,.9)">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer">What is white-label PPC management?</summary>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mt-3">White-label PPC management is when a specialist team builds, optimizes, and reports on your clients' paid search and paid social campaigns under your agency's brand. Factor42 Media executes the work invisibly while your agency owns the client relationship.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-xl border p-5" style="border-color:rgba(0,102,255,.15);background:rgba(255,255,255,.9)">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer">Which paid media platforms do you manage?</summary>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mt-3">We manage Google Ads (Search, Performance Max, Display, Shopping), Microsoft Ads, and paid social across Meta, TikTok, LinkedIn, and Pinterest — all under your agency's brand.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-xl border p-5" style="border-color:rgba(0,102,255,.15);background:rgba(255,255,255,.9)">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer">Is the reporting white-labeled?</summary>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mt-3">Yes. All dashboards and performance reports are delivered under your agency's brand, so your clients experience one seamless agency from strategy to execution.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ CTA ═══ -->
  <section class="py-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center rounded-3xl p-10" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,102,255,.08),rgba(0,180,216,.08));border:1px solid rgba(0,102,255,.15)">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif">Ready to scale paid media without scaling headcount?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-base mb-7 max-w-xl mx-auto">Add a certified white-label PPC and paid social team behind your brand — and only pay for capacity when you use it.</p>
      <a href="/consultation" class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-semibold text-white">Book a Free Consultation →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "serviceType": "White-Label PPC & Paid Social Management",
    "name": "White-Label PPC Management & Paid Social Fulfillment Services",
    "description": "White-label paid search and paid social management for marketing agencies. Enterprise-grade Google Ads setup, daily budget optimization, and white-labeled reporting delivered under your agency's brand.",
    "url": "https://factor42media.com/white-label-ppc.html",
    "areaServed": "Worldwide",
    "provider": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Factor42 Media",
      "alternateName": ["Factor42", "Factor 42 Media"],
      "url": "https://factor42media.com"
    },
    "hasOfferCatalog": {
      "@type": "OfferCatalog",
      "name": "White-Label PPC & Paid Social Services",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": { "@type": "Service", "name": "White-Label Google Ads Management" } },
        { "@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": { "@type": "Service", "name": "Paid Search Campaign Setup & Optimization" } },
        { "@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": { "@type": "Service", "name": "Paid Social Media Management" } },
        { "@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": { "@type": "Service", "name": "White-Labeled PPC Reporting" } }
      ]
    }
  }
  </script>
<script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://factor42media.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "White-Label PPC & Paid Social", "item": "https://factor42media.com/white-label-ppc.html" }
    ]
  }
  </script>
<script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is white-label PPC management?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "White-label PPC management is when a specialist team builds, optimizes, and reports on your clients' paid search and paid social campaigns under your agency's brand. Factor42 Media executes the work invisibly while your agency owns the client relationship."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Which paid media platforms do you manage?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We manage Google Ads (Search, Performance Max, Display, Shopping), Microsoft Ads, and paid social across Meta, TikTok, LinkedIn, and Pinterest — all under your agency's brand."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is the reporting white-labeled?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes. All dashboards and performance reports are delivered under your agency's brand, so your clients experience one seamless agency from strategy to execution."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>